.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH activity 1  "activity " 
.SH NAME
activity \- Show the account activity log (Peak C7): sign\-ins, snippet creates/pushes/forks, token changes and trust grants, newest first. The same log is in the web app under Settings \- Security, exportable as JSON
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBactivity\fR [\fB\-\-limit\fR] [\fB\-\-registry\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Show the account activity log (Peak C7): sign\-ins, snippet creates/pushes/forks, token changes and trust grants, newest first. The same log is in the web app under Settings \- Security, exportable as JSON
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-limit\fR \fI<LIMIT>\fR [default: 50]
How many events to list at most (1\-200)
.TP
\fB\-\-registry\fR \fI<REGISTRY>\fR
Registry base URL (default: `FORGEHUB_REGISTRY` or config)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH EXTRA
Examples:
  fg activity
  fg activity \-\-limit 10 \-\-json
